---
description: Choose the right Vibestudio provenance read or interpret a bounded set of real VCS and trajectory edges.
uses: [provenanceMechanism]
args:
  request: ProvenanceRequest
returns: ProvenanceReport
---
For a route question call provenanceMechanism with the actual user's question. Reuse attached-read when the attached observation answers it. Use search if it requests memory recall without the Personal facility installed. If attached-read is insufficient, choose cause for a named change or direct-edges for direct lineage. Return the chosen read only. For attribution call attributeOrigin. For a constraint review call weighConstraint. Preserve original compact refs from the readback and mark gaps. Do not execute a query or infer hidden work from a gap.
For a live-history question, call reviewLiveHistory with the exact assignment and return its ordered findings.
